      "locked": false,
      "text": "合并块内部网格线隐藏，文字挂在合并锚点格 · 右下角单元格内嵌图形（content 角色，随格裁剪可选）· 行列把手在选中表格后出现，拖动可移动行/列",
      "originalText": "合并块内部网格线隐藏，文字挂在合并锚点格 · 右下角单元格内嵌图形（content 角色，随格裁剪可选）· 行列把手在选中表格后出现，拖动可移动行/列",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "checklist-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 2160,
      "width": 405.0,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1179,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1180,
      "index": null,
